Excalibur gives automatic searching.  Excalibur's enchantment improves
the chances of detecting secret doors and corridors.  Excalibur at +0
gives the usual 1-in-7 chance of detection.  Excalibur at +5 and above
gives a chance of 6-in-7 chance of detection.  That's the maximum
searching benefit.

Excalibur gives automatic searching.  Your luck effects the chances of
detecting traps.  The formula for luck is not the same as the formula
for enchantment.

When I read the code for searching it seemed strange to me.  If my
summary here is what happens and if my summary correctly paraphrases
TJR's statement I now know why I found the code strange.


